<v><b>A:</b></v> Does she like her job?

00:00:08.665 --> 00:00:10.135
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes, she does.

00:00:12.171 --> 00:00:12.681
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:14.151 --> 00:00:15.382
<v><b>A:</b></v> What does he do?

